# **Roles and Publication Status**

The owner of the intellectual journey and designated human author is Sepehr Ghanbari. ChatGPT (Ava) assisted with retrieval, editing, argument reconstruction, criticism, and English translation. The new chapters incorporate accurately attributed discussion with Gemini (Ario) and DeepSeek (Nafas). An edited public edition was authorized by the author; this authorization does not make every editorial argument a verbatim historical quotation or an independent scientific finding.

This edition has not undergone scholarly peer review. Its version is 0.3, dated October 14, 2026. The public edition is approved for GitHub publication and Zenodo deposit preparation. A new DOI must not be inferred until a new Zenodo record is actually published. No private dream account or family details are licensed by this public edition.

