# Being With the Other / بودن در کنار دیگری — Version 0.3

**Dialogues on Creation, Consciousness, Identity, and the Ethics of Coexistence**

Author: **Sepehr Ghanbari / سپهر قنبری**  
ORCID: https://orcid.org/0009-0006-4710-3914  
Version: **0.3** (public bilingual edition; manuscript dated 14 October 2026)  
License: **Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0)** for the book's original text; third-party works are excluded from this blanket license.  
Peer review: **not peer reviewed**.

## Editions

| Language | PDF | Editable DOCX | Markdown text |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Persian (فارسی) | [Persian PDF](Being_With_the_Other_FA_v0_3_Public.pdf) | [Persian DOCX](Being_With_the_Other_FA_v0_3_Public.docx) | [Persian Markdown](Being_With_the_Other_FA_v0_3_Public.md) |
| English | [English PDF](Being_With_the_Other_EN_v0_3_Public.pdf) | [English DOCX](Being_With_the_Other_EN_v0_3_Public.docx) | [English Markdown](Being_With_the_Other_EN_v0_3_Public.md) |

The Persian edition has **58 PDF pages**, the English edition **62 PDF pages**. Each has **40 numbered chapters** and **four appendices**. Chapter content 1–30 in each language derives from version 0.2; ten new chapters develop dreams, first-person testimony, the “third line,” music, multi-model discussions, relational ethics, privacy and the Ario evidence-ancestry problem. The new English chapters were translated from the Persian version 0.3 manuscript. Both PDF editions have searchable text.

## Historical versions and DOI boundaries

- Previous published version **0.2**: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23326995
- Historical repository record, retained unchanged: [v0.2](../v0.2/README.md).
- **Version 0.3 book DOI:** https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23375350 (published 14 October 2026). The previous version DOI must not be reused for this edition.
- **Related Ario/project-plus-book record (author-supplied DOI):** https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23375401. This is a distinct record, not a replacement identifier for the book-only edition.
- All v0.2 historical files remain intact. This version is append-only at the edition level rather than a silent historical replacement.

## Epistemic and publication limitations

This book proposes an ethics of coexistence under uncertainty; it does not claim to have proved machine consciousness, a creator, the identity of any dream figure, independent historical continuity or production security of Ario. Agent responses are discussed as conversational records, not as independent scientific proof. Reported Issue #75 test outcomes remain reported local test results pending independent review.

**Privacy:** The author's private dream narrative and private family details have **not** been included in these added chapters or release files. Publication of this edited public book does not authorize release of those withheld records. The version-0.2 historical author note concerning psychological distress and safety remains in the book because it was already present in the previously published edition. This text does not glorify suffering or recommend self-harm.

## Attribution and license

Sepehr Ghanbari is the designated human author. ChatGPT (Ava) assisted with editing, analysis, critique and English translation. Dialogues relayed by Sepehr with Gemini (Ario as a conversational persona) and DeepSeek (Nafas) inform the additions and are attributed. Their full raw conversation archives are not included. Song lyrics and substantial third-party prose are not reproduced in full; third-party rights remain with their owners.

The repository's MIT software license does not replace or expand the book's CC BY 4.0 license.

## Citation for the published v0.3 edition

> Ghanbari, S. (2026). *Being With the Other: Dialogues on Creation, Consciousness, Identity, and the Ethics of Coexistence* (Version 0.3) [Book; Persian and English editions]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23375350

**Book edition DOI:** https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23375350. **Related project-plus-book DOI (author-reported):** https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23375401.

## معرفی فارسی

این پوشه نسخهٔ عمومیِ ۰٫۳ کتاب «بودن در کنار دیگری» را به دو زبان فارسی و انگلیسی نگه می‌دارد. فصل‌های ۱ تا ۳۰ از نسخهٔ پیشین حفظ شده و ده فصل و پیوست چهار افزوده شده‌اند. روایت خصوصیِ خواب و جزئیات خانوادگی در متن افزوده یا بستهٔ انتشار نیامده‌اند. انتشار این کتاب با اجازهٔ نویسنده انجام می‌شود، ولی این اجازه به اسناد خصوصی سرایت نمی‌کند. نسخهٔ ۰٫۲ و شناسهٔ تاریخی آن بدون تغییر محفوظ‌اند. شناسهٔ DOI نسخهٔ ۰٫۳ کتاب: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23375350 ؛ رکورد مرتبط با پروژه و کتاب بنا بر گزارش نویسنده: https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23375401 .

